Z||000019||Taijiguy||04-03-2001||06:54 PM||||My last G/F hated my Fiero. She was a bit of a snob, not really ever happy about anything. That explains why she's an *ex*. I bet most of you guys know the type. None of the women I've dated since really minded it, in fact the last woman I dated was used to Jags and other luxury cars (an internet security specialist, she has more money than God) and she LOVED my Fiero. Go figure. I do get alot of the young girls at the pickup window saying "I really like your car, it's *cute* &lt;barf&gt; (That's only because you aren't paying attention to the aggresive rumble in the exhaust, or the sound of the 4 bbl devouring cubic foot after cubic foot of your breathing air for combustion purposes, and aren't feeling the vibration of the lopey engine idle being transmitted through poly bushings to the frame of the car in your loins..."cute" my ass...)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>~Taiji<P><p>[This message has been edited by Taijiguy (edited 04-03-2001).]||||reg||6
