Z||000029||filthyscarecrow||04-06-2001||02:58 AM||||well, mine turns heads when i let off at 4000rpm in 1st gear and it just crackles and pops and sounds wicked. but i drive it too fast for most people to even see it. i don't slow down around corners really at all (why bother when you know where the apex is and yuo've got a wide enough exit to pull it off... saves gas, right? right.) i actually got pulled over once for going around a corner too fast. but as far as dating is concerned, i don't drive it to impress gold-digging sorority girls. i don't give a flying fokker whether someone else likes my car. ~I~ like my car and that's all that matters. people who cruise are lookign to impress other people. i go fast because i get a kick out of driving it fast. if someone blinks and doesn't see me, boo hoo for them. i doubt they'd care anyway because it's just a fiero, right? <P>------------------<BR>allow me to show you my exhaust pipes...||||reg||1
